# A computer in a product
Inputs → processing → outputs

Embedded does not necessarily mean Internet-connected.

---

# Analogue and digital
ADC converts a voltage to a code.
10 bits → 1024 codes, numbered 0–1023

A code is not automatically a percentage.

---

# Calibration
100 × (raw − dry) / (wet − dry)

Dry 800 · Wet 300 · Raw 550 → 50
Equal references are invalid.

---

# Hysteresis
Below 30: on
Above 40: off
Between: preserve state

Why does history matter?

---

# Test the whole path
Component tests → integration → physical measurements

Simulation cannot verify wiring or calibration.

---

# Design responsibly
Safe low voltage · Appropriate pin limits
Understandable outputs · Error indication
Sampling interval · Data minimisation

---

# Exit ticket
Trace levels 45, 29, 32, 39, 41.

Explain one limit of your evidence.
